WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Water pump
What it does: Circulates coolant to carry heat away from the engine.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Water pump
How it works: The rotating blades transfer energy to it.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Water pump
How it moves: The housing stays fixed; shaft and impeller rotate. Their exact speed ratio depends on the pulleys.
